  "ruleText": "Env-Or 702.01 “Ambient groundwater quality standards (AGQS)” means “ambient groundwater quality standards” as defined in RSA 485-C:2, I, as reprinted in Appendix C.\n\nSource. #8812, eff 2-1-07; ss by #10832, eff 6-1-15; ss by #14420, eff 11-4-25, EXPIRES: 11-4-35",
